        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME, FUTURE HERO!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of grandma’s farm, you can sens it: time has come for you to set out on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no idea what you’ll find out there: incredible treasures, brave folks waiting for a hero to save them, epic quests revealing your courage, or something else …</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s up to you to discover it all…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what, move forward with caution and make the right choices… or start over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TEXT-BASED ADVENTURE WHERE YOU LEARN FROM YOUR MISTAKES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perciflette is a die-and-retry game, so your (bad) choices will be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No save, no checkpoint, stay focused, or you might end up missing grandma’s farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for the true adventurers hungry for glory : we even prepared some achievements just for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WITH MUSIC BY ALEXANDER NAKARADA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll spend some time trying to reach the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So we needed music you never get tired of. And Alexander Nakarada’s work was exactly what we were looking for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LITTLE BACKSTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perciflette was born 5 years ago during a Game Jam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 3 days, we imagined the story, developed the mechanics, created the designs, and all of it formed this adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few years later, we had the crazy idea to take the project all the way and publish it here.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME, FUTURE HERO!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of grandma’s farm, you can sens it: time has come for you to set out on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no idea what you’ll find out there: incredible treasures, brave folks waiting for a hero to save them, epic quests revealing your courage, or something else …</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s up to you to discover it all…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what, move forward with caution and make the right choices… or start over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TEXT-BASED ADVENTURE WHERE YOU LEARN FROM YOUR MISTAKES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perciflette is a die-and-retry game, so your (bad) choices will be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No save, no checkpoint, stay focused, or you might end up missing grandma’s farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for the true adventurers hungry for glory : we even prepared some achievements just for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WITH MUSIC BY ALEXANDER NAKARADA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll spend some time trying to reach the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So we needed music you never get tired of. And Alexander Nakarada’s work was exactly what we were looking for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LITTLE BACKSTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perciflette was born 5 years ago during a Game Jam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 3 days, we imagined the story, developed the mechanics, created the designs, and all of it formed this adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few years later, we had the crazy idea to take the project all the way and publish it here.</p>",
        "short_description": "Welcome, future hero! Perciflette is a narrative adventure with a simple goal : Find the way out. Explore, move forward with caution, and make the right choices…or start over!",
